<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were moderately</p>
<p>active, steady to $0.25 lower. Top $59.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   230-260 lbs    59.00-59.25</p>
<p>US  2-3   260-280 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady to 0.50 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    47.50-47.75</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
